{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cinch Bridge</i> is a 2D physics-based puzzle game built around the theme of trial and error. The rules are simple: if the frog protagonist reaches the goal, you clear the stage. However, all you can do is place gimmicks and watch what happens. Use bouncing mushrooms, gusts of wind, and other items to guide the frog safely to the goal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game progresses through a series of stages, each featuring unique terrain and a variety of gimmicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984560/extras/909a88b6bc19d969db5071d8e084b1a8.poster.avif?t=1756977007\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984560/extras/909a88b6bc19d969db5071d8e084b1a8.webm?t=1756977007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984560/extras/909a88b6bc19d969db5071d8e084b1a8.mp4?t=1756977007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take items out of your backpack and place them on the stage, then press start. Once the challenge begins, you can no longer control the character\u2014just sit back and watch, hoping the frog makes it to the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984560/extras/175d92d028006a7a11a54ab77ae78e5e.poster.avif?t=1756977007\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984560/extras/175d92d028006a7a11a54ab77ae78e5e.webm?t=1756977007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984560/extras/175d92d028006a7a11a54ab77ae78e5e.mp4?t=1756977007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the frog falls, simply hit the retry button and adjust your item placement. Sometimes a small change is all it takes to succeed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D physics-based puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stage-based progression designed for short play sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable with just one hand</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984560?t=1756977007","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984560/579ed877faa4639e9c7e420ac84acdf0267613f3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756977007","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984560/5e0f5c423dc49c2369c22a9ba2997de008f2a075/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756977007","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984560/5e0f5c423dc49c2369c22a9ba2997de008f2a075/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756977007","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cinch Bridge</i> is a 2D physics-based puzzle game built around the theme of trial and error. The rules are simple: if the frog protagonist reaches the goal, you clear the stage. However, all you can do is place gimmicks and watch what happens. Use bouncing mushrooms, gusts of wind, and other items to guide the frog safely to the goal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game progresses through a series of stages, each featuring unique terrain and a variety of gimmicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984560/extras/909a88b6bc19d969db5071d8e084b1a8.poster.avif?t=1756977007\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984560/extras/909a88b6bc19d969db5071d8e084b1a8.webm?t=1756977007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984560/extras/909a88b6bc19d969db5071d8e084b1a8.mp4?t=1756977007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take items out of your backpack and place them on the stage, then press start. Once the challenge begins, you can no longer control the character\u2014just sit back and watch, hoping the frog makes it to the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984560/extras/175d92d028006a7a11a54ab77ae78e5e.poster.avif?t=1756977007\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984560/extras/175d92d028006a7a11a54ab77ae78e5e.webm?t=1756977007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984560/extras/175d92d028006a7a11a54ab77ae78e5e.mp4?t=1756977007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the frog falls, simply hit the retry button and adjust your item placement. Sometimes a small change is all it takes to succeed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D physics-based puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stage-based progression designed for short play sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable with just one hand</p></li></ul>","developers":["Amana"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984560/2f7205ae2ce8077c3bc5c58aa3d243ec2702bedb/header.jpg?t=1756977007","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 amana. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3984560/1726028585/ae36906adde663a6572bab1fcf3b008b636abcf5/1756913391/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756977005","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3984560/1726028585/ae36906adde663a6572bab1fcf3b008b636abcf5/1756913391/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756977005","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3984560/1726028585/ae36906adde663a6572bab1fcf3b008b636abcf5/1756913391/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756977005","id":257192690,"name":"\u30c7\u30e2\u7248PV","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257192690/6fe8bbfbb1749220790571a5b8b247d07eb7ef09/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756977005"}],"name":"Cinch Bridge","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Wi